<%- include('partials/head') %>
<div class="centred">
  <div class="panel card-narrow">
    <div class="panel-head"><h3>The console is locked</h3></div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <p>This deployment is reachable from the network — <%= reason %> — so the console
         will not open without a password. It does not fall back to an open page, because the first thing to
         find an open one would not be you.</p>
      <ul class="small t-body loose">
        <% problems.forEach(function (p) { %><li><%= p %></li><% }) %>
      </ul>
      <p class="small muted flush-bottom">
        Set a password on the machine running <%= branding.botName %>:<br>
        <code class="code-block">rumi console --set-password</code><br>
        then restart the bot.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body></html>
